        {
          "Id": "stan_q_who",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "That all depends who is asking. To some, I am just another face in a crowded shuttleport, to others, I am a person of interest. ",
              "Unknown2": 0
            },
            {
              "Text": "I believe that is because I am just so interesting.\\n\\nI take no side in the conflict that fuels this planet, I just use the blind loyalty of others for my own benefit. Some say there is no place for neutrality on this planet, but I am not sure I prescribe to that idea.\\n\\nThat is all I will say on the subject. Now, where were we?",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
