        {
          "Id": "stan_goldman_002",
          "PromptText": "My my... Aren't we eager? Ambition is something that is dreadfully lacking from new colonists, but... Oh dear. You have a <i>problem</i> don't you?",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-210219 19:03:00.701 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "stan_goldman_002_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I arrived here without an ID and Alex said you could help me...",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:03:00.7021036Z",
              "NextNodeId": "stan_goldman_003",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "stan_goldman_002_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:03:00.7021036Z",
              "NextNodeId": "stan_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "stan_goldman_003",
          "PromptText": "You aren't the first one to wander through here with that particular issue as of late. As it so happens, you're in the right place and speaking to the right man... and if you can scratch my back, we'll see about relieving that itch on yours too.\\nThere's a... particular strongbox being kept in a small shack nearby. I <i>would</i> get it myself, but I only facilitate procurement, not enact. Get me whats in that box and I will help you out.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-210219 19:03:02.985 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "stan_goldman_003_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I suppose I don't have much choice...",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:03:02.9866935Z; Answer=0 → Action59+Delete TalkStan + QFU Buy a Lockpick",
              "NextNodeId": "stan_goldman_004",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "stan_goldman_003_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:03:02.9866935Z",
              "NextNodeId": "stan_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "stan_goldman_004",
          "PromptText": "No, no you don't. Now, I'll be uploading the target's location to your NCU.\\n\\nThe work itself is relatively simple:\\n1: Buy a lockpick.\\n2: Sneak into the small building undetected. Locate the strongbox your NCU directs you toward and clean it out. Inside you'll find an Adaptation Factory.\\n3: Once you've procurred this item, return to me and we'll see about creating your unique ID chip.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-210219 19:03:05.923 Unknown2=0 (capture spelling procurred)",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "stan_goldman_004_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:03:05.9248823Z",
              "NextNodeId": "stan_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "stan_deliver_001",
          "PromptText": "Good to see you again... Did you find Antonio's Adaption Factory?",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-212421 19:25:03.703 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "stan_deliver_001_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I think I have what you were looking for.",
